pacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">최종 선발 이후 멘토 활동 중도 포기는 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -46.2pt; margin-left: 46.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">  </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">장학금 지급과 관련하여 이중 근로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">타부서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">는 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -46.2pt; margin-left: 46.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">  </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">휴학을 고민 중인 학생이나 취업을 앞두고 있는 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">야간수업 수강예정인 학생은 추천 자제</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -46.2pt; margin-left: 46.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">  </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">주간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 한양중고딕; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">야간 및 주말에